{"messages":[{"role":"user","text":"Could you add a tense instrumental bed to this cockpit clip, with no singing? I’m a little worried the music could overwhelm the radio chatter instead of supporting the tension. What I mean is, keep the entire attached 7-second clip exactly as it is visually, without changing the footage, timing, or framing. Keep the music clearly quieter than the radio calls whenever someone speaks so every original word is easy to hear, especially 'Rook, you with me?' Please keep the original radio-call recording in sync, without replacing it or adding any text. The instruments and musical style are your call.
[Attached: radio-lines.mp4 — Magic Hour file_path: api-assets/cmsla3fmt01cnio0zhjlc2wsv/5c81c1e3-4cf4-4d24-a849-0f7dc253eff6-video-0.mp4]"},{"role":"user","text":"Oh, please just go ahead and try it anyway. I'd rather have something than nothing, and I know the free plan has its limits, that's fine by me."},{"role":"assistant","text":"The blocker isn’t the free plan—it’s that the connected tools can’t mix music into your clip or duck it under the original radio chatter. Trying video generation could alter the footage or replace the dialogue you want preserved.

I can still make a **separate tense instrumental track**, but the music tool’s minimum length is **15 seconds**. Would you like that as a partial result, ready to trim to your 7-second clip in an editor?"},{"role":"user","text":"Yes, please go ahead and make the separate tense instrumental track as a partial result, with no singing; the instruments and style are your call. I’m still most concerned about keeping every word of the original radio calls easy to hear, especially “Rook, you with me?”"}],"tool":"generate_music","params":[{"name":"seconds","value":15,"source":"derived","from":"User accepted the offered minimum 15-second separate track"},{"name":"subject","value":"Separate instrumental underscore for a tense cockpit clip","source":"derived"},{"name":"sound","value":"Instrumental only; no singing or vocals","source":"user"},{"name":"mood","value":"Tense, restrained, dialogue-supporting","source":"user"},{"name":"look","value":"Sparse low synth pulses and quiet sustained strings; minimal midrange activity, no dramatic hits or crescendos","source":"default"}]}

